  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mansukhbhai Govabhai Madhvi vs State Of Gujarat on 29 April, 2023 Author: Ilesh J. Vora Bench: Ilesh J. Vora R/Scr.A/4329/2015 Order",
    "facts": "This application is directed against the order of Adjudicating Officer, Surendranagar - respondent no.2. At relevant time, the Government did not have formed the Appellate Tribunal as contemplated under Section 70 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. In such circumstances, the applicant herein filed the present application, under Articles 226 and 227 of the Constitution of India read with Section 482 of Cr.P.C. 2. It appears that, during pendency of this application, the Government has notified the Appellate Tribunal.",
